type: software
title: "AdviceIT: an instrument for studying explainable AI investment advice"
abstract: "An interactive research instrument for studying how explanation styles (none, feature-based, counterfactual, confidence, conversational LLM) and advisor model type (glass-box rules or neural network) calibrate trust and appropriate reliance on AI investment advice."
